    "description": "Match with your values. Meet your soul mate.\r\nWith 4 million members, Inshallah is the 1st meeting community for Muslims in Europe. \r\nChat for FREE wherever you are. \r\nSearch for your soulmate while preserving your privacy. \r\nExchange messages on the chat and plan a meeting in real life.\r\nThanks to Inshallah 329,000 unions have been formed in France, Belgium, Germany, the United Kingdom, the Netherlands... Our mission is to connect those who seek and share the borrowed values of humanity and respect, the values of Islam!\r\nSearch and find your soul mate by \u201cswiping\u201d on Inshallah. To help you make the choice that suits you, each profile is enriched with photos and detailed information. You like a person? Swipe to the right and \u201cLike\u201d their profile. Your profile has been \u201cLiked\u201d back by this profile, it\u2019s a \u201cMatch\u201d! \r\nYour privacy is our priority. Preserve it by blurring your photos and making them accessible only to your Matchs and Premium members. \r\nGeneral conditions and terms of use: https://help.inshallah.com/en/support/solutions/articles/60000602154-conditions-g%C3%A9n%C3%A9rales-d-utilisation\r\nPrivacy policy: https://help.inshallah.com/en/support/solutions/articles/60000622908-politique-de-confidentialit%C3%A9",
